  "display_fullname": "Guardian Assault Psionic Assault Psychic Shockwave",
  "display_help": "Psychic Shockwave is a devastating psionic attack that wracks the minds of all nearby foes. Affected foes may have a reduced attack rate and may be left disoriented. Psychic Shockwave has a moderate chance to grant you Insight. If the caster has Insight when this power is used Psychic Shockwave will also cause a moderate amount of psionic damage over time. Damage: Moderate Recharge: Slow",
